tile.resistor10k.tooltip.0=10 kohm resistor; opposite terminals.
tile.resistor10k.tooltip.1=High resistance for small currents.
tile.led.tooltip.0=Polarized LED: anode + faces forward.
tile.led.tooltip.1=Cathode - faces back; 2 V drop.
